# PixiJS Documentation Preference

When implementing or modifying PixiJS-related features, consult the local
PixiJS docs submodule first and reference it in decisions or explanations.

- Local docs path: `documentation/pixi-docs`
- Prefer `documentation/pixi-docs/docs` and `documentation/pixi-docs/versioned_docs`
- If unsure, search within the submodule before coding
- If the docs do not cover the topic, say so and use PixiJS source as fallback

## Updating the docs submodule

If the docs seem out of date, update the submodule and commit the pointer:

```
git -C documentation/pixi-docs pull
git add documentation/pixi-docs
```
